"""Combo bổ sung — role-play (AI soạn mới, 2026-10). Mỗi combo: RA hỏi thông tin → RP giải quyết vấn đề → RE kể trải nghiệm."""

C = [
    dict(id="rp-hospital-1", topic="rp_hospital", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You have had a toothache for a few days and want to see a dentist. Call the dental clinic and ask three or four questions to make an appointment.",
         """Hello, is this Smile Dental Clinic? Hi, I've had a toothache for a few days, and I'd like to make an appointment. First, do you have any openings this week, maybe on Thursday or Friday afternoon? I work until five, so a late appointment would be best. Also, how much does a basic check-up cost, and do you accept health insurance? And one more thing, if I need an X-ray, can I do it at the clinic on the same day? Okay, great. Could you book me for Friday at five thirty, please? My name is Minh. Thank you so much."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. On the day of your appointment, something urgent comes up at work and you cannot go. Call the clinic, explain the situation, and suggest two or three alternatives.",
         """Hi, this is Minh. I have an appointment with Dr. Lan today at five thirty. I'm really sorry, but something urgent just came up at work. There's a problem with one of our products, and my manager needs me to stay late, so I won't be able to make it. I don't want to waste the doctor's time, so I'm calling to let you know as early as possible. Would it be possible to move my appointment to tomorrow morning? I'm free before nine. If not, Sunday morning would also work for me. Or, if the doctor is fully booked, could you put me on the waiting list and call me if someone cancels? Again, I'm very sorry for the trouble. Thank you for understanding."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had to cancel or change an important appointment at the last minute? Tell me what happened and how you handled it.",
         """Yes, that happened to me about a year ago. I had an appointment for a health check-up at a big hospital in Hanoi, and I had booked it almost a month in advance, because it was always fully booked. On the morning of the appointment, I was about to leave when my daughter suddenly got a high fever and started vomiting. My wife was on a business trip, so there was nobody else to take care of her. I felt stuck, but my daughter was obviously more important. So I called the hospital, explained the situation and apologized. The receptionist was very kind. She moved my appointment to the next week and didn't charge me any fee. Then I took my daughter to the clinic near our home, and luckily, she got better after two days. Since then, I always try to have a backup plan for important days."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-bank-1", topic="rp_bank", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to open a new bank account. Go to the bank and ask the staff three or four questions about opening an account.",
         """Good morning. I'd like to open a new savings account, so could you help me with a few questions? First, what documents do I need to bring? I have my ID card with me, but I'm not sure if I need anything else. Second, what's the interest rate for a six-month savings account at the moment? Also, is there a monthly fee if my balance is low? And finally, can I manage the account through your mobile banking app, and how long does it take to set it up? Thank you, that's very helpful."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. You realize that you lost your bank card, and you think someone may have used it. Call the bank, explain the situation, and offer two or three solutions.",
         """Hello, I'm calling because I think I lost my debit card. I last used it yesterday evening at a supermarket, and this morning, I couldn't find it in my wallet. Also, I just got a message saying that someone paid two million dong at an online shop with my card. I didn't make that payment. Could you please lock my card right away? Then, I'd like to report the transaction as fraud and ask for a refund. I can come to the branch this afternoon to sign the forms if you need. And could you issue a new card for me? If it's faster, I can pick it up at the branch near my office. Thank you for your help."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a problem with a bank or with money? Tell me what happened and how the situation was resolved.",
         """Yes, I had a stressful problem with a bank transfer last year. I was paying the deposit for our family's trip to Da Nang, and I transferred ten million dong to the travel agency using my banking app. But I was in a hurry, and I typed one number wrong in the account number. The money went to a stranger's account. When I realized it, I felt sick. I called the bank's hotline right away and explained what happened. They told me they couldn't take the money back without the receiver's permission, but they would contact that person. I had to go to the branch and fill out a form. For three days, I couldn't sleep well. Finally, the bank called me and said the receiver had agreed to return the money. I was so relieved. Now I always check the name of the receiver twice before I press send."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-internet-1", topic="rp_internet", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0303", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to get internet service for your new apartment. Call an internet service provider and ask three or four questions about their plans.",
         """Hello, I just moved into a new apartment, and I'm interested in getting home internet. Could you tell me about your plans? First, what speeds do you offer, and how much is each plan per month? My wife and I use it a lot, and I take online English classes in the evening, so I need a stable connection. Second, is there a discount if I pay for a year in advance? Also, does the price include the Wi-Fi router, or do I have to buy it? And how soon can a technician come to install it? I'd like it set up by this weekend if possible."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. Your internet has not been working for two days, and you have an important online meeting tomorrow. Call the company, explain the problem, and suggest two or three ways to fix it.",
         """Hi, I'm calling about my home internet. It has been down for two days now. The light on the router is red, and I've already tried restarting it several times, but nothing works. The problem is that I have a very important online meeting with a client tomorrow morning at nine. So, could you send a technician to my apartment this afternoon or early tomorrow morning? If that's not possible, could you check the line from your side and reset my connection remotely? And as a backup, could you give me some free mobile data for a few days, so I can use my phone as a hotspot? I'd really appreciate your help."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a problem with your internet or a device at an important moment? Tell me what happened and how you dealt with it.",
         """Yes, it happened when I was taking an online English test for a training program at my company. The test was forty minutes long and I had to keep my camera on the whole time. About twenty minutes in, my Wi-Fi suddenly disconnected, and the screen froze. I panicked, because if I left the test for more than five minutes, it would be canceled. I quickly turned on the hotspot on my phone and connected my laptop to it. Luckily, the test came back after about two minutes, and I could continue. My answers were saved, but I was so nervous that I couldn't concentrate well for the rest of the test. Afterward, I emailed the HR team to explain what happened, and they said it was fine. Now, before any online test or meeting, I always prepare a backup connection."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-concert-1", topic="rp_concert", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to buy tickets for a concert next month. Call the ticket office and ask three or four questions about the tickets.",
         """Hi, I'm calling about the concert at the city stadium next month. I'd like to buy two tickets, but I have a few questions first. What kinds of tickets do you have, and how much are they? I'd prefer seats, not standing tickets. Also, can I buy them online, or do I have to come to the office? Is there an early-bird discount if I buy now? And one more thing, is it okay to bring a five-year-old child, and does she need her own ticket? Thank you."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. When your tickets arrive, you see that they are for the wrong date. Call the ticket office, explain the problem, and offer two or three alternatives.",
         """Hello, my name is Minh, and I bought two tickets for the concert on the twentieth through your website. I just received them by email, but the date on the tickets is the nineteenth, not the twentieth. I'm sure I chose the right date, and I have a screenshot of my order. Unfortunately, I have to work on the nineteenth, so I can't go that day. Could you please change them to tickets for the twentieth, even if the seats are a bit different? If that's not possible, could you give me a full refund? Or, as a third option, could I get a voucher for a future concert? Please let me know which option works. Thanks."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a problem with tickets, or had to change your plans for an event? Tell me what happened.",
         """Yes, that happened to me last year. I wanted to surprise my wife on her birthday, so I bought two tickets for a comedy show in Hanoi. I bought them from a person on a social media group, because the official tickets were sold out. When we arrived at the theater, the staff scanned our tickets and said they were fake. I felt so embarrassed, especially because it was supposed to be a special night for my wife. I tried to contact the seller, but he had already blocked me. Instead of going home sad, we walked around the Old Quarter, had dinner at a nice rooftop restaurant and took lots of photos. In the end, my wife said she enjoyed it even more than a show. But I learned my lesson. I only buy tickets from official websites now."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-library-1", topic="rp_library", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to get a library card at a new library in your city. Call the library and ask three or four questions about it.",
         """Hello, I heard that the new city library opened last month, and I'd like to get a library card. Could you tell me how to register? Do I need to come in person, and what documents should I bring? How much does a card cost per year? Also, how many books can I borrow at a time, and for how long? I have a young daughter too, so I'd also like to know if there's a children's section and whether kids can get their own card. Thank you."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. You borrowed a book from the library, but you have lost it. Call the library, explain the situation, and suggest two or three solutions.",
         """Hi, I'm calling because I have a problem with a book I borrowed. It's called The Art of Quality, and it's due next Monday. I'm really sorry, but I think I lost it. I took it with me on a business trip, and I must have left it on the bus. I've already called the bus company, but they haven't found it. So, I'd like to know what my options are. I can buy a new copy of the same book and bring it to the library. Or, if that's not possible, I can pay for the book. If you prefer, I could also donate a different book of the same value. Please let me know what's best."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever lost or damaged something that belonged to someone else? Tell me what happened and how you handled it.",
         """Yes, I remember one time in university. My roommate lent me his camera for a weekend trip to Ha Long Bay with my friends. It was an expensive camera that he had saved money for months to buy. On the second day, we were taking photos on a boat, and a big wave suddenly hit the side. I slipped, and the camera fell and hit the floor. The lens cracked, and I felt terrible. I didn't know how to tell him. When I got back, I told him the truth right away and apologized. He was upset, but he appreciated that I was honest. I took it to a repair shop and paid for a new lens, which cost almost all of my savings. It was a tough lesson, but we're still close friends today, and now I'm extremely careful when I borrow anything."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-airline-1", topic="rp_airline", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0303", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You are planning to fly to another city for a vacation. Call the airline and ask three or four questions about your flight.",
         """Hello, I have a flight to Da Nang next Friday, and I'd like to ask a few questions. First, how much checked baggage is included in my ticket? I'm traveling with my wife and daughter, so we might have two big suitcases. Second, can we choose our seats in advance, so we can sit together? Also, what time should we arrive at the airport for a domestic flight? And finally, if we need to change our flight date, how much is the fee? Thank you for your help."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. When you arrive at the airport, you find out that your flight has been delayed for five hours. Talk to the airline staff, explain your situation, and suggest two or three alternatives.",
         """Excuse me, I just saw on the screen that our flight to Da Nang is delayed for five hours. That's a big problem for us. I'm traveling with my wife and our five-year-old daughter, and we've already booked a hotel and a tour for this afternoon. Is there another flight today that we could switch to? Even a different airline would be okay if you can help us change. If that's not possible, could you give us a refund, so we can book another flight ourselves? Or at least, could you give us a place to rest and some meal vouchers while we wait? My daughter is already tired. Thank you."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a problem when you were traveling by plane? Tell me what happened and how you resolved it.",
         """Yes, I had a problem with my luggage on a trip to Phu Quoc. When we landed, my wife's suitcase came out, but mine never did. We waited until the very last bag, and it still wasn't there. I was really worried, because all my clothes and my daughter's medicine were inside. I went to the lost and found counter and filled out a report. The staff told me the suitcase had been put on a different flight by mistake, and it would arrive the next day. In the meantime, I had to buy a few T-shirts and some basic things at a shop near the hotel. The next evening, they delivered my suitcase to our hotel, and everything was inside. After that trip, I always keep important things like medicine and chargers in my carry-on bag."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-rental-1", topic="rp_rental_car", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to rent a car for a family trip. Call a car rental company and ask three or four questions.",
         """Hi, I'd like to rent a car for a family trip next weekend, from Saturday morning to Monday evening. Could you tell me what kinds of cars you have available? We need a seven-seat car, because my parents are coming with us. How much is it per day, and does the price include insurance? Also, what documents do I need, and do I have to pay a deposit? And finally, can you deliver the car to my apartment, or do I have to pick it up at your office? Thanks."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. During your trip, the rental car breaks down on the highway. Call the rental company, explain the situation, and suggest two or three solutions.",
         """Hello, this is Minh. I rented a seven-seat car from you on Saturday. I'm calling because the car just broke down on the highway, about thirty kilometers from Ninh Binh. The engine light came on, there was a strange noise, and then the car stopped. My family is with me, including my elderly parents and my young daughter, so we need help quickly. Could you send a tow truck and a replacement car to our location? If that takes too long, could you pay for a taxi to take us to our hotel, and then bring a new car there tomorrow? Or, if there's a partner garage nearby, I could wait for them to fix it. I'll send you our location now."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a problem with a car or other vehicle during a trip? Tell me what happened and how you solved it.",
         """Yes. A few years ago, I rented a motorbike to explore Da Lat with my wife. On the second day, we rode to a waterfall about twenty kilometers outside the city. On the way back, the motorbike suddenly ran out of gas on a quiet mountain road. I had forgotten to check the fuel gauge, and there wasn't a gas station anywhere nearby. It was getting dark and cold, and my wife was not happy with me. I walked along the road pushing the bike for about fifteen minutes, until I found a small house. An old woman there sold gasoline in plastic bottles, so I bought two. It was more expensive, but it saved us. We made it back to the hotel safely, and I apologized to my wife with a nice dinner. Since then, I always fill up the tank before going anywhere far."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-delivery-1", topic="rp_delivery", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. You want to order food from a new restaurant for a party at your home. Call the restaurant and ask three or four questions.",
         """Hello, I'm planning a small party at home this Saturday for about ten people, and I'd like to order some food from your restaurant. First, do you have any set menus for groups, and how much are they? Some of my guests are vegetarian, so do you have vegetarian dishes too? Also, do you deliver to my area? I live in the apartment complex near Youth Park. And finally, how far in advance do I need to order, and can I pay by bank transfer? Thank you."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. The food for your party arrives, but some dishes are missing and one is the wrong order. Call the restaurant, explain the problem, and give two or three alternatives.",
         """Hi, I ordered a party set for ten people from your restaurant about an hour ago, under the name Minh. The food just arrived, but there's a problem. Two dishes are missing, the spring rolls and the fried rice. Also, instead of the vegetarian noodles, you sent beef noodles, and two of my guests don't eat meat. My guests are already here, so could you send the missing dishes and the correct noodles as soon as possible? If you can't deliver them within thirty minutes, could you refund the cost of those dishes instead? Or, you could give me a discount on my next order. Please let me know quickly. Thank you."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Think about a time you invited people to your home for a party or a celebration. Did anything go wrong while you were preparing or during the event? Describe the whole story.",
         """Yes. Last year, we hosted my daughter's fourth birthday party at our apartment. We invited about fifteen people, including her friends from kindergarten and their parents. I had ordered a big cartoon birthday cake from a bakery a week before. But on the morning of the party, the bakery called and said their oven had broken, and they couldn't make the cake. I was shocked, because my daughter had been talking about that cake for days. My wife and I quickly divided the work. She stayed home to decorate, and I drove around the city to every bakery I knew. Finally, I found a simple strawberry cake, and I bought a few small toy figures to put on top. It wasn't exactly the cake she wanted, but she loved it anyway. The party was a success, and now I always order cakes from two different shops, just in case."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-friend-1", topic="rp_friend_plans", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. A friend has invited you to go camping next weekend. Call your friend and ask three or four questions about the trip.",
         """Hey Tuan, it's Minh. Thanks for inviting me to go camping next weekend. I'm really interested, but I have a few questions. First, where exactly are we going, and how long will it take to get there? Also, who else is coming? I'd love to bring my wife and daughter if it's a family trip. What should I bring, like a tent or a sleeping bag, or do you have extra ones? And how much do you think it will cost per person for food and the campsite fee? Let me know, and I'll check my schedule."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. You cannot go on the camping trip because of an urgent family matter. Call your friend, explain the situation, and suggest two or three alternatives.",
         """Hi Tuan, it's Minh again. I'm really sorry, but I have some bad news. I just got a call from my mother, and my father has to go into the hospital for minor surgery this weekend. So, I need to go back to my hometown to take care of him. I know you've already booked the campsite and bought food for us. I'll pay my share of the costs, of course. Maybe we could plan another camping trip next month instead, and I'll organize it this time. Or, if you still have space, you could invite Hoa and her husband in my place. Again, I'm really sorry for the last-minute change. I'll call you when I'm back."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had to cancel plans with a friend because of something unexpected? Tell me what happened and how your friend reacted.",
         """Yes, that happened about two years ago. My best friend from university was getting married in Ho Chi Minh City, and he asked me to be his groomsman. I was so excited, and I bought the plane tickets two months early. But one week before the wedding, our factory had a serious quality problem with a big order, and my manager told everyone in my team that we couldn't take any days off. I felt terrible, because it was one of the most important days of my friend's life. I called him and explained everything. He was disappointed, but he said he understood. On the wedding day, I joined a video call during the ceremony and gave a short speech. A month later, I visited him and his wife in person and took them out for dinner. He still teases me about it, but our friendship is still strong."""),
    ]),
    dict(id="rp-work-1", topic="rp_work_project", cat="role_play", src="SRC-0304", items=[
        ("RA", "I'd like to give you a situation and ask you to act it out. Your manager has just assigned you to a new project. Ask your manager three or four questions about the project.",
         """Thank you for choosing me for this project, I'm really excited about it. I'd like to ask a few questions to make sure I understand everything. First, what's the main goal of the project, and how will we measure success? Second, who else will be on the team, and who will I report to day to day? Also, what's the deadline, and are there any important milestones before that? And finally, is there a budget for training or new equipment if we need it? Thank you, that helps a lot."""),
        ("RP", "I'm sorry, but there is a problem I need you to resolve. A client has asked to move the project deadline two weeks earlier. Call your manager, explain the situation, and suggest two or three alternatives.",
         """Hi, I'm calling about the client project we discussed last week. The client just emailed me, and they want us to finish two weeks earlier than planned, because they're launching their product sooner. Honestly, with our current team, it's almost impossible to do everything well by then. So I have a few ideas. First, we could ask two people from another team to help us for those two weeks. Second, we could deliver the most important part first, by their new date, and finish the rest on the original deadline. Or, we could ask the client to extend the deadline by just one week instead of two. Which option do you think is best? I'd like to reply to them by tomorrow."""),
        ("RE", "That's the end of the situation. Have you ever had a difficult problem at work or school that you had to solve? Tell me what happened and how you handled it.",
         """Yes, about a year ago, we had a big problem at my factory. A customer in Europe found that some of the phones we had shipped had a small scratch on the camera lens. They threatened to return the whole order, which was tens of thousands of units. My team was responsible for the final inspection, so I felt a lot of pressure. First, we checked all the products that were still in our warehouse, and we found that the problem came from one machine on the packing line. We stopped that machine and fixed it with the engineering team. Then, we checked thousands of phones by hand for three days, working until late at night. In the end, we only had to replace a small number of units, and the customer accepted our report. It was exhausting, but it taught me how important teamwork is."""),
    ]),
]
